55,3,1,talk,Mio,,I'll vote for Campus Intensive. It's the only way to keep the costs low and fair for everyone.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"I worry about the bonding, but the lodge seems too risky. I will vote for the Mountain Training Centre to get them away.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,I can't support the public center's paperwork or the campus cooking. I'll vote for the Coastal Lodge to save the organizers.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Rin,,Eight people to a room is a no for me! I'll vote for the Coastal Lodge so we can actually sleep.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"I cannot support the lodge due to the financial risk. Between A and B, A is the most fiscally responsible. I vote Campus.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, @Rin, please think about the cost! The lodge is way too far and expensive.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, if we stay on campus, the members who live nearby will just go home. We won't bond at all.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Misaki, the ""cost"" of the organizers' time and sanity is also a factor. We can't keep burning out the leaders.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Rin,,I just want to be awake for the training! The lodge sounds like the only place we'll get real rest.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Ryuji, we can find a way to handle the cooking. We cannot handle a deficit in the club accounts.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Mio,,I'm sticking with Campus. It's the only one that doesn't risk someone's money.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"I see the dilemma. But for the sake of the club's unity, I'll stick with the Mountain Centre.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,The lodge is the only professional option that doesn't involve a lottery or a kitchen shift. I'm staying with C.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Rin,,I'm staying with C! No more crowded rooms for me.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I'm staying with A. The budget must come first.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
